5a","title":"牛辅卜见客董越来卜为外谋遂杀董越","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p035a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"牛辅卜见客董越来卜为外谋遂杀董越","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p035a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0098","role":"卜杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p035a-q"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0078","role":"被杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p035a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"牛辅屯陕时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p035a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-p035a-q","source_order":[6,138,"P035a"],"order":1553}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0098","name":"牛辅","evidence":["xunyu-q-o056","dongyuan-q-o017"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-o056-xunyu-p0098","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-o056"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o017-xunyu-p0098","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o017"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p035-xunyu-p0098","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p035"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p036-xunyu-p0098","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p036"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o017a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-693e72937b34d2f18740","layer":"original","quote":"初，卓女婿中郎将牛辅，典兵别屯陕〖1〗；分遣校尉李傕、郭汜、张济，略陈留、颍川诸县。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o017b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-693e72937b34d2f18740","layer":"original","quote":"卓死，吕布使李肃至陕，欲以诏命诛辅。辅等逆与肃战；肃败，走弘农，布诛肃。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o017c-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-693e72937b34d2f18740","layer":"original","quote":"其后辅营兵有夜叛出者，营中惊。辅以为皆叛，乃取金宝，独与素所厚（友）〔支〕胡赤儿等五六人相随〖2〗，逾城，北渡河。赤儿等利其金宝，斩首送长安。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":81,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p035a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-effe676bbfb8d0ba8fc6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“辅恇怯失守，不能自安。常把辟兵符，以斧锧致其旁，欲以自强。见客，先使相者相之，知有反气与不；又筮知吉凶，然后乃见之。中郎将董越，来就辅；辅使筮之，得兑下离上。筮者曰：‘火胜金，外谋内之卦也。’即时杀越。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-658d808644fdaac28880","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o017","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-693e72937b34d2f18740","layer":"original","quote":"初，卓女婿中郎将牛辅，典兵别屯陕〖1〗；分遣校尉李傕、郭汜、张济，略陈留、颍川诸县。卓死，吕布使李肃至陕，欲以诏命诛辅。辅等逆与肃战；肃败，走弘农，布诛肃。﹝一﹞其后辅营兵有夜叛出者，营中惊。辅以为皆叛，乃取金宝，独与素所厚（友）〔支〕胡赤儿等五六人相随〖2〗，逾城，北渡河。赤儿等利其金宝，斩首送长安。比傕等还，辅已败，众无所依。欲各散归，既无赦书，而闻长安中欲尽诛凉州人〖3〗，忧恐不知所为。用贾诩策，遂将其众而西；所在收兵，比至长安，众十余万。﹝二﹞与卓故部曲樊稠、李蒙、王方等，合围长安城。十日城陷，与布战城中，布败走。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":264,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p035","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-effe676bbfb8d0ba8fc6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“辅恇怯失守，不能自安。常把辟兵符，以斧锧致其旁，欲以自强。见客，先使相者相之，知有反气与不；又筮知吉凶，然后乃见之。中郎将董越，来就辅；辅使筮之，得兑下离上。筮者曰：‘火胜金，外谋内之卦也。’即时杀越。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-658d808644fdaac28880","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p036","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-e8c6c8addf48b2c9c820","layer":"pei","quote":"《献帝纪》云：“筮人常为越所鞭，故因此以报之。”","attribution":"《献帝纪》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-658d808644fdaac28880","start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o056","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-5d90dcb2f24cf49d47b3","layer":"original","quote":"董卓之入洛阳，诩以太尉掾为平津都尉〖1〗。迁讨虏校尉〖2〗。卓婿中郎将牛辅，屯陕，诩在辅军。卓败，辅又死，众恐惧；校尉李傕、郭汜、张济等欲解散，间行归乡里。诩曰：“闻长安中议，欲尽诛凉州人。而诸君弃众单行，即一亭长能束君矣〖3〗。不如率众而西，所在收兵〖4〗；以攻长安，为董公报仇；幸而事济，奉国家以征天下〖5〗；若不济，走未后也〖6〗。”众以为然。傕乃西攻长安。语在《卓传》。﹝一﹞后诩为左冯翊〖7〗，傕等欲以功侯之〖8〗。诩曰：“此救命之计，何功之有！”固辞不受。又以为尚书仆射。诩曰：“尚书仆射，官之师长，天下所望；诩名不素重，非所以服人也。纵诩昧于荣利，奈国朝何？”乃更拜诩尚书，典选举；多所匡济，傕等亲而惮之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":276,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":313,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
